// # oocat package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oocat (layers/L3-tools).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oocat.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oocat.oo.
